    {"id": "Z7", "group": "Z", "cls": "unscoreable", "consequence": "EMF from cables alters behaviour", "blocker": "No Danish national cable layer with energisation dates was found, and **the biological response is not measured**"},
    {"id": "Z8", "group": "Z", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "The attenuation budget is never partitioned", "blocker": "**Draft exists** (`hypodrafts/Z8.md`). Kd plus chlorophyll, CDOM and particle proxies on the same casts — but `Lysdaempning` has no path length, so the draft apportions variance, not a budget"},
    {"id": "Z9", "group": "Z", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Epiphytes shade the plant regardless of water clarity", "blocker": "Epiphyte biomass on eelgrass: ODA records epiphyte cover per transect point, not biomass, and no biomass series was found"},
    {"id": "Z10", "group": "Z", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Works plumes exceed natural turbidity long enough to matter", "blocker": "Works chronology plus the turbidity monitoring large projects must do: dated pile-driving events are in the ICES noise register; project turbidity monitoring was at no public endpoint"},
